10 I have ten chairs 我有十張椅 ngo yau shap cheung i

11 Where is that hair brush? 响個擦頭掃喺邊處 ko ko ts''at-t''au-so hai pin ch''ü?

12 There are twenty books on 檯面有二十部書 t''oi min yau yi shap po shü

the tahle

