  ('cvh-029-01', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', '1874', 29, 1, NULL, '19 Five water bottles and fifty 五個水樽,五十簿 books 書 ''ng ko shui-tsun, ''ng shap po shu

