Children 仔女 tsui'' nü'' Milk 牛奶 ngau-nai''', 'Trees倉樹p''ohshü''Together,with,and共kungLeaves樹葉shü''ipFish魚üGreen綠色,青lukshik,ts''ingFowl鶏kaiBrown棕色tsungshikHam火腿foh''t''viChildren仔女tsui''nü''Milk牛奶ngau-nai''', 'verified'),
  ('cvh-038-01', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', '1874', 38, 1, NULL, 'Girl 女仔 nü'' tsai'' Price 價錢 ka'' ts''in

Boy 男仔 nam tsai'' Make (cause to be done) 整 ching''

To look for, to fetch 揾 wan'' Make (to do) 做 tso''

Potatoes 薯仔 shu-tsai'' Catty (1⅓ lb.) 斤 kān

Do. (lit. Holland root) 荷蘭薯 ho-lan-shü Cents 仙士 sin sze

Houseboy 事仔 sze'' tsai''

Eggs 鶏蛋 koi tan''

NAM TSAI 男仔 a boy is literally a male child.

The word SIN SZE 仙士 for cent is merely an attempt to reproduce the English expression.

Particular attention must be paid to the accent of the words SZE TSAI 事仔 house-boy; if the emphasis be thrown on the first word it means a dead child.

Note the distinction between "make" cause to be done, and "make" meaning simply to do.

When girls and boys are spoken of antithetically in the same sentence NÜ and TSAI only need be used.

1 Trees have green leaves 樹有青葉 shü yau ts''ing ip

2 Have you potatoes? 你有薯仔冇 ni yau shu-tsai mo?

3 I have two children 我有兩個仔女 ngo yau leung ko tsai nü

4 Have you boys and girls? 你有仔女冇 ni yau tsai nü mo?

5 I have one boy and one girl 我有一個仔一個女 ngo yau yat ko tsai, yat ko nü

6 The boy likes fish 個仔愛魚 ko tsai oi ü

7 Make some fish curry 整啲咖喱魚 ching ti ka li ü

8 Get me some veal and ham 拈啲牛仔肉共火腿來我 nim ti ngau-tsai-yuk kung foh-t''ui loi ngo

9 Buy me some milk and eggs 買啲牛奶,買啲鶏蛋我 mai ti ngau-nai, mai ti kai-tan ngo

10 I want fowls, eggs, and vegetables 我要鶏,鶏蛋,共菜 ngo iu kai, kai-tan, kung ts''oi

11 What is the price of potatoes? 薯仔係乜野價錢呢 shu tsai hai mât yé ka ts''in ni?

12 They are three cents a catty 係三個仙士一斤 hai sam ko sin-sze yat kän

13 Send for six catties 使人買六斤 shai yan mai luk kän

14 Buy me four catties of vegetables 買四斤菜我 mai sze kän ts''oi ngo', 'Girl女仔nü''tsai''Price價錢ka''ts''inBoy男仔namtsai''Make(causetobedone)整ching''Tolookfor,tofetch揾wan''Make(todo)做tso''Potatoes薯仔shu-tsai''Catty(1⅓lb.)斤kānDo.(lit.Hollandroot)荷蘭薯ho-lan-shüCents仙士sinszeHouseboy事仔sze''tsai''Eggs鶏蛋koitan''NAMTSAI男仔aboyisliterallyamalechild.ThewordSINSZE仙士forcentismerelyanattempttoreproducetheEnglishexpression.ParticularattentionmustbepaidtotheaccentofthewordsSZETSAI事仔house-boy;iftheemphasisbethrownonthefirstworditmeansadeadchild.Notethedistinctionbetween"make"causetobedone,and"make"meaningsimplytodo.WhengirlsandboysarespokenofantitheticallyinthesamesentenceNÜandTSAIonlyneedbeused.1Treeshavegreenleaves樹有青葉shüyauts''ingip2Haveyoupotatoes?你有薯仔冇niyaushu-tsaimo?3Ihavetwochildren我有兩個仔女ngoyauleungkotsainü4Haveyouboysandgirls?你有仔女冇niyautsainümo?5Ihaveoneboyandonegirl我有一個仔一個女ngoyauyatkotsai,yatkonü6Theboylikesfish個仔愛魚kotsaioiü7Makesomefishcurry整啲咖喱魚chingtikaliü8Getmesomevealandham拈啲牛仔肉共火腿來我nimtingau-tsai-yukkungfoh-t''uiloingo9Buymesomemilkandeggs買啲牛奶,買啲鶏蛋我maitingau-nai,maitikai-tanngo10Iwantfowls,eggs,andvegetables我要鶏,鶏蛋,共菜ngoiukai,kai-tan,kungts''oi11Whatisthepriceofpotatoes?薯仔係乜野價錢呢shutsaihaimâtyékats''inni?12Theyarethreecentsacatty係三個仙士一斤haisamkosin-szeyatkän13Sendforsixcatties使人買六斤shaiyanmailukkän14Buymefourcattiesofvegetables買四斤菜我maiszekänts''oingo', 'verified'),
  ('cvh-039-01', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', '1874', 39, 1, NULL, '15 Tell the girl to fetch a needle-woman 叫個女仔去,叫個補衫婆來 kiu ko nü-tsai hui kiu ko po-sham-p''oh loi

16 Make some vegetable soup 整的菜湯 ching ti ts''oi-t''ong

17 That boy is good, that girl is bad 個男仔好,個女仔唔好 ko nam-tsai ho, ko nü-tsai ''m ho

18 Have you fish to sell? 你有魚賣冇 ni yau ü mai mo?

19 No, the girl has fish to sell 有,個女仔有魚賣 mo; ko nü-tsai yau ü mai

20 Mend my white socks 補翻我對白襪 po fan ngo tui pak-mät

21 Brush my brown clothes 擦我的棕個色衣服 ts''at ngo ko ti tsung-shik i-fuk

22 Tea leaves are green and black 茶葉有青色,有黑色嘅 ch''a ip yau ts''ing-shik, yau hak-shik ke

23 How many eggs have you to sell? 你有幾多鶏蛋賣 ni yau ki to kai-tan mai?

24 Ring the bell to call the boy 摮鐘叫事仔來 ngo chung kiu sze-tsai loi

25 This fish is bad; take it away 呢的魚唔好,擰佢去喇 ni ti ü ''m ho, ning k''ü hü la

26 Get me some good soup beef 揾啲好湯肉來我 wan ti ho t''ong yuk loi ngo

27 What have you there? 你响處有乜野 ni ko ch''ü yau mât ye

28 I have ham and veal 我有火腿有牛仔肉 ngo yau foh t''ui, yau ngau-tsai-yuk

29 These are very large trees 呢啲樹好大樖 ni ti shü ho tai p''oh

30 Are these good eggs? 呢的鶏蛋好唔呢 ni ti kai-tan ho ''m ni?

31 No, they are bad eggs, I have some good milk 唔係,個的唔好鶏蛋我有啲好牛奶 ''m ho: ko ti ''m ho kai-tan; ngo yau ti ho ngau-nai', '15Tellthegirltofetchaneedle-woman叫個女仔去,叫個補衫婆來kiukonü-tsaihuikiukopo-sham-p''ohloi16Makesomevegetablesoup整的菜湯chingtits''oi-t''ong17Thatboyisgood,thatgirlisbad個男仔好,個女仔唔好konam-tsaiho,konü-tsai''mho18Haveyoufishtosell?你有魚賣冇niyauümaimo?19No,thegirlhasfishtosell有,個女仔有魚賣mo;konü-tsaiyauümai20Mendmywhitesocks補翻我對白襪pofanngotuipak-mät21Brushmybrownclothes擦我的棕個色衣服ts''atngokotitsung-shiki-fuk22Tealeavesaregreenandblack茶葉有青色,有黑色嘅ch''aipyauts''ing-shik,yauhak-shikke23Howmanyeggshaveyoutosell?你有幾多鶏蛋賣niyaukitokai-tanmai?24Ringthebelltocalltheboy摮鐘叫事仔來ngochungkiusze-tsailoi25Thisfishisbad;takeitaway呢的魚唔好,擰佢去喇nitiü''mho,ningk''ühüla26Getmesomegoodsoupbeef揾啲好湯肉來我wantihot''ongyukloingo27Whathaveyouthere?你响處有乜野nikoch''üyaumâtye28Ihavehamandveal我有火腿有牛仔肉ngoyaufoht''ui,yaungau-tsai-yuk29Theseareverylargetrees呢啲樹好大樖nitishühotaip''oh30Arethesegoodeggs?呢的鶏蛋好唔呢nitikai-tanho''mni?31No,theyarebadeggs,Ihavesomegoodmilk唔係,個的唔好鶏蛋我有啲好牛奶''mho:koti''mhokai-tan;ngoyautihongau-nai', 'needs_review'),
