INSERT INTO articles (id, corpus, issue, issue_date, page, seq, title, text, text_norm, status) VALUES
  ('cvh-040-01', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', '1874', 40, 1, NULL, '<table><tr><td>Cake</td><td>餅</td><td>peng''</td><td>Tiffin</td><td>小食, 食</td><td>siu'' shik, shik</td></tr><tr><td>Mustard</td><td>芥末</td><td>kui''-mut</td><td></td><td>晏, 食</td><td>an'', shik</td></tr><tr><td>Pepper</td><td>胡椒末</td><td>n-tsiu-mut</td><td></td><td>晏晝</td><td>an'' chau''</td></tr><tr><td>A slice</td><td>一塊</td><td>yat ju''</td><td>Ready</td><td>齊備, 便</td><td>ts''ai-pi'', pin''</td></tr><tr><td>Vinegar</td><td>醋</td><td>ts''o''</td><td>Take care</td><td>小心</td><td>siu'' sām</td></tr><tr><td>Pastry</td><td>餅食</td><td>peng''-shik</td><td>A piece</td><td>一啲</td><td>yat ti</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2">To hand (at table)</td><td rowspan="2">俾</td><td rowspan="2">pi''</td><td>Gold</td><td>金</td><td>kūm</td></tr><tr><td>Silver</td><td>銀</td><td>ngān</td></tr><tr><td>A meal</td><td>一飱</td><td>yat ts''an</td><td>To eat</td><td>食, 吃</td><td>shik, yak</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2">thus, (adv. of quality) then, in this case</td><td rowspan="2">噉, 就</td><td rowspan="2">kom, tsau</td><td>To like</td><td>中意</td><td>chang-i</td></tr><tr><td>Or</td><td>唺</td><td>chi''</td></tr></table>

Breakfast and dinner are simply the "little" and the "great meal."

To take care is literally "little heart," caution, it is supposed, inducing a contraction of that organ.

To "hand" a thing is rendered by PI 俾 to give.

Or is sometimes rendered by 唺 chi. The Chinese prefer however to alter the construction of the phrase when it implies antithesis (see sentence 17 infra.)

1 Do you like to eat fowl? 你中意食鶏唔呢 ni chung i shik kai ''m ni?

2 No, I don''t like fowl, I like eggs 唔中意吃鶏,我中意鶏蛋 ''m chung i yak kai; ngo chung i kai-tan

3 Boil the soup quickly 快啲烚湯 fai ti shap t''ong

4 I want you to bake this cake 要你局呢的餅 iu ni kuk ni ti peng

5 Green cabbage is good 青菜好吃 ts''eng ts''oi ho yak

6 Hand me the mustard 俾芥末過我 pi kai-mut kwo ngo

7 Bring me some vinegar 拈啲醋我 nim ti ts''o ngo

8 What pastry have you? 你有乜野餅食呢 ni yau mât ye peng-shik ni?

9 Buy me a piece of cake 買一塊餅過我 mai yat fai peng kwo ngo

10 Hand me some water 俾的水我 pi ti shui ngo

11 Breakfast is ready 小餐便咯 siu ts''an pin lok

12 When will dinner be ready? 大餐幾時便呢 tai ts''an ki shi pin ni?

13 It will be ready directly (quickly) 就便咯 tsau pin lok

14 Bring the tiffin 拈小食來 nim siu shik loi

15 This makes a good meal 呢的噉就係一飱好飯 ni ti kom tsau hai yat s''as ho fan', '<table><tr><td>Cake</td><td>餅</td><td>peng''</td><td>Tiffin</td><td>小食,食</td><td>siu''shik,shik</td></tr><tr><td>Mustard</td><td>芥末</td><td>kui''-mut</td><td></td><td>晏,食</td><td>an'',shik</td></tr><tr><td>Pepper</td><td>胡椒末</td><td>n-tsiu-mut</td><td></td><td>晏晝</td><td>an''chau''</td></tr><tr><td>Aslice</td><td>一塊</td><td>yatju''</td><td>Ready</td><td>齊備,便</td><td>ts''ai-pi'',pin''</td></tr><tr><td>Vinegar</td><td>醋</td><td>ts''o''</td><td>Takecare</td><td>小心</td><td>siu''sām</td></tr><tr><td>Pastry</td><td>餅食</td><td>peng''-shik</td><td>Apiece</td><td>一啲</td><td>yatti</td></tr><tr><tdrowspan="2">Tohand(attable)</td><tdrowspan="2">俾</td><tdrowspan="2">pi''</td><td>Gold</td><td>金</td><td>kūm</td></tr><tr><td>Silver</td><td>銀</td><td>ngān</td></tr><tr><td>Ameal</td><td>一飱</td><td>yatts''an</td><td>Toeat</td><td>食,吃</td><td>shik,yak</td></tr><tr><tdrowspan="2">thus,(adv.ofquality)then,inthiscase</td><tdrowspan="2">噉,就</td><tdrowspan="2">kom,tsau</td><td>Tolike</td><td>中意</td><td>chang-i</td></tr><tr><td>Or</td><td>唺</td><td>chi''</td></tr></table>Breakfastanddinneraresimplythe"little"andthe"greatmeal."Totakecareisliterally"littleheart,"caution,itissupposed,inducingacontractionofthatorgan.To"hand"athingisrenderedbyPI俾togive.Orissometimesrenderedby唺chi.TheChinesepreferhowevertoaltertheconstructionofthephrasewhenitimpliesantithesis(seesentence17infra.)1Doyouliketoeatfowl?你中意食鶏唔呢nichungishikkai''mni?2No,Idon''tlikefowl,Ilikeeggs唔中意吃鶏,我中意鶏蛋''mchungiyakkai;ngochungikai-tan3Boilthesoupquickly快啲烚湯faitishapt''ong4Iwantyoutobakethiscake要你局呢的餅iunikuknitipeng5Greencabbageisgood青菜好吃ts''engts''oihoyak6Handmethemustard俾芥末過我pikai-mutkwongo7Bringmesomevinegar拈啲醋我nimtits''ongo8Whatpastryhaveyou?你有乜野餅食呢niyaumâtyepeng-shikni?9Buymeapieceofcake買一塊餅過我maiyatfaipengkwongo10Handmesomewater俾的水我pitishuingo11Breakfastisready小餐便咯siuts''anpinlok12Whenwilldinnerbeready?大餐幾時便呢taits''ankishipinni?13Itwillbereadydirectly(quick