  ('cvh-046-02', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', '1874', 46, 2, 'LESSON XVI.', 'To empty 整空 ching'' hung To lend 借 tse''

To employ 請, 使, 用 ts''ing'', shai'', yung'' A dog 隻狗 (chek) kau

To feed 喂 wai'' Parents 父母 fu'' mo''

To learn 學 hok Everywhere 處處 ch''ü''-ch''ü''

A door 門 mun To interpret 傳話,繙譯 ch''ün-wa'', fan yik

At 在 tsoi` To keep (retain) 留翻 lau fan

A friend 朋友 p''ang yau'' To kill 打死 ta'' s:e''

To find 揾着 wan'' cheuk To know (be acquainted with) 識 shik

To finish 做完 tso'' ün To lock 鎖 soh''

