  ('cvh-056-02', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', '1874', 56, 2, 'LESSON XX.', 'To steer (a boat 把舦, 揸 pa'' t''ai'', cha Debt欠債 him`-chas''

