PARTICLES (CONTINUED.)

4. Affirmative particles Li 哩 Le'' 咧

5. Interrogative and Responsive particle often conveying an idea of disapprobation Me 咩

6. Restrictive particles often used in answers but seldom in questions Che 啫 Chi'' 啡

7. Doubting particle expressing doubt Kwa'' 啩

8. Desiderating particle expressing desire Ai 唉

9. Admonishing or directing particles, not so intense as to convey the idea of command Po'' 噃 O 呵

In some cases two of these are conjoined: thus LO'' PO'' (Nos. 2. & 9 ) have the force of a strongly declarative expression.

1 Good morning Sir! look at that hill
早晨呀先生, 望吓响個山
tso-shan a sin-shang; mong ha ko-ko shan
2 What sort of a coat have you put on?
你着住點傣嘅衫呢
ni chenk chü tim yeung ke sham ni?
3 I am wearing a blue coat
我着藍衫
ngo cheuk lam-sham
4 Is it a blue or a brown coat?
係藍色只係棕色衫呢
hai lam shik chi hai chung shik ni?
5 Assist me to carry this book
幫助我抬呢部書
pong choh ngo t''oi ni po shü
6 Tell him to lock the door
呌佢鎖門囉
kiu k''ü soh mun lo
7 Where did you say he lived?
你話佢喺邊處住呢
ni wa k''ü hai pin-ch''ü chü ni?
8 He lives at Hongkong
佢喺香港居住嘅
k''ü hai Heung-kong kii chü ke
9 Does he ever quarrel with you?
佢有時同你嗌交冇
k''ü yau-shi t''ung ni ai-kau mo?
10 No, he fears to do so
冇, 佢唔敢嘅
mo; k''ü ''m kom ke
11 I don''t think he lives here
我估佢唔喺呢處住
ngo ku k''ü ''m hai ni-ch''ü chü', '<table><tr><td>Toputon</td><td>着住</td><td>cheukchü&#x27;</td><td>Tolookon</td><td>望住</td><td>mong&#x27;chü&#x27;</td></tr><tr><td>Towear</td><td>戴住</td><td>tai&#x27;chü&#x27;</td><td>Torefuse</td><td>推却</td><td>t&#x27;uik&#x27;euk</td></tr><tr><td>Tolock</td><td>鎖住</td><td>soh&#x27;chü&#x27;</td><td>Todrinkup</td><td>飲晒</td><td>yäm&#x27;sai&#x27;</td></tr><tr><td>Tofear</td><td>怕到</td><td>pa&#x27;to&#x27;</td><td>Tocopy</td><td>抄起</td><td>ch&#x27;auhi&#x27;</td></tr><tr><td>Toliveat</td><td>居住</td><td>küchü&#x27;</td><td>Toforget</td><td>忘却</td><td>mongk&#x27;euk</td></tr><tr><td>Tobecomean-noyed</td><td>怒起</td><td>no&#x27;hi&#x27;</td><td>Toassist</td><td>扶起,幫助</td><td>fuhi&#x27;,pongchoh&#x27;</td></tr></table>PARTICLES(CONTINUED.)4.AffirmativeparticlesLi哩Le''咧5.InterrogativeandResponsiveparticleoftenconveyinganideaofdisapprobationMe咩6.RestrictiveparticlesoftenusedinanswersbutseldominquestionsChe啫Chi''啡7.DoubtingparticleexpressingdoubtKwa''啩8.DesideratingparticleexpressingdesireAi唉9.Admonishingordirectingparticles,notsointenseastoconveytheideaofcommandPo''噃O呵Insomecasestwooftheseareconjoined:thusLO''PO''(Nos.2.&9)havetheforceofastronglydeclarativeexpression.1GoodmorningSir!lookatthathill早晨呀先生,望吓响個山tso-shanasin-shang;monghako-koshan2Whatsortofacoathaveyouputon?你着住點傣嘅衫呢nichenkchütimyeungkeshamni?3Iamwearingabluecoat我着藍衫ngocheuklam-sham4Isitablueorabrowncoat?係藍色只係棕色衫呢hailamshikchihaichungshikni?5Assistmetocarrythisbook幫助我抬呢部書pongchohngot''oiniposhü6Tellhimtolockthedoor呌佢鎖門囉kiuk''üsohmunlo7Wheredidyousayhelived?你話佢喺邊處住呢niwak''ühaipin-ch''üchüni?8HelivesatHongkong佢喺香港居住嘅k''ühaiHeung-kongkiichüke9Doesheeverquarrelwithyou?佢有時同你嗌交冇k''üyau-shit''ungniai-kaumo?10No,hefearstodoso冇,佢唔敢嘅mo;k''ü''mkomke11Idon''tthinkheliveshere我估佢唔喺呢處住ngokuk''ü''mhaini-ch''üchü', 'needs_review'),
