  ('cvh-080-01', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', '1874', 80, 1, NULL, 'T''UNG 同 with, frequently supplies the English word for; e.g. buy that for me. NI T''UNG NGO MAI KO-KO 你同我買响個.

