  ('cvh-091-01', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', '1874', 91, 1, 'LESSON XXXI.', '<table border="1"><tr><td>To work in (as gold, &amp;c.)</td><td>打起</td><td>ta'' hi''</td><td>To reach with the</td><td>伸到 (or)</td><td>shăn to'' (or)</td></tr><tr><td>To pull or haul on</td><td>扯住</td><td>ch''e'' chü''</td><td>hands</td><td>擙到</td><td>o to''</td></tr><tr><td>To haul or drag</td><td>扯起</td><td>ch''e'' hi''</td><td>To pacify</td><td>安住 (or)</td><td>on chü'' (or)</td></tr><tr><td>To send (transmit)</td><td>寄到</td><td>ki'' to''</td><td></td><td>和息</td><td>woh sik</td></tr><tr><td>To heap up</td><td>推起</td><td>t''ui hi''</td><td>To run after</td><td>追到</td><td>chui to''</td></tr><tr><td>To prevent</td><td>阻住</td><td>cho'' chü''</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr></table>

Words signifying nouns are often converted into adjectives by placing YAU 有 before and KE 嘅 after them; as a wealthy man YAU TS''IN KE YAN, 有錢嘅人; a sick man YAU PENG KE YAN 有病嘅人.

<table border="1"><tr><td rowspan="2">Bad language</td><td>唔好嘅說話 (or)</td><td>''m ho ke'' shüt wa'' (or)</td></tr><tr><td>爛口話</td><td>lan'' hau'' wa''</td></tr><tr><td>A crafty man</td><td>乖滑嘅人</td><td>kwai wät ke'' yan</td></tr><tr><td>Detestable</td><td>可惡</td><td>ho'' u''</td></tr><tr><td>Amiable</td><td>可愛</td><td>ho'' oi''</td></tr><tr><td>Hateful</td><td>可恨</td><td>ho'' hau''</td></tr></table>

CLASSIFIERS (continued.)

19. Fu'' 副 to assist, is used as the classifier of lots, sets, beads, tools, &c.

20. Kin'' 件 to divide, is applied to goods, affairs of business, articles of dress, &c.

21. Fai'' 塊 a piece of, is applied to portions of stone, metal, earth, wood, cloth, &c

22. T''un 團 a lump, is applied to earth, dough, clay, &c.

23. T''ong 堂 a hall, is applied to screens, curtains, ladders, sails, (seldom used.)

24. Hong 行 a series, is applied to a row of characters, or objects, such as trees ships, &c.

A mosquito curtain 一堂蚊帳 yat t''ong mān-cheung'' Earth (mud) 坭 nai

A willow tree 一樖柳樹 yat p''o lau''-shü'' Dough 麵 min''

A ladder 一堂梯 yat t''ong t''ai

