  ('cvh-101-01', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', '1874', 101, 1, NULL, '24 Put it back where you got 你喺邊處攞嚟嘅,就 ni hai pin-ch''ü lo lai ke, tsau chai it from 擠翻个處喇 fan ko-ch''ü la

