13 There is no news from America 花旗國冇新聞 Fa-k''i kwok mo sān-mān

14 Did he invite many guests? 佢請好多人客咩 k''ü ts''ing ho to yan-hak me?

15 No; all of them had left the 唔係；佢哋喊嘭哈 ''m hai; k''ü-ti ham-pang-lang place 都離喨响笪地 to li hiu ko tat ti-fong方咯 lok

16 Is the ferryman also a fisher- 响個渡主又係攞魚 ko-ko to-chü yau hai loh-ü-lo ''m man? 佬唔係呢 hai ni?

17 That gentleman wishes to see 响位人客想見將 ko wai yan-hak seung kin tseung-

the general 軍 kwan

18 When will that gentleman响個人客幾時至ko-ko yan-hak ki shi chi hü leave?去呢ni?

19 The Portuguese will stay there 响個西洋人住好耐 ko-ko Sai-yeung yau chu ho noi some time 至去咯 chi hü ke lok

20 Did you put the almanac in 你擠本通書在書匱 ni chai pun t''ung-shü tsoi shü-

the bookcase? 係唔係 kwai'' hai ''m hai?

21 No, I fear it is on the stove 唔係，我怕佢在個 ''m hai, ngo p''a k''ü tsoi ko cheung bed 張炕床嚟 hong-ch''ong lai

