  ('cvh-105-01', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', '1874', 105, 1, NULL, '24 Do the Chinese wear spectacles? 唐人帶眼鏡唔呢 t''ong-yan tai ngan-keng ''m ni？

25 They wear spectacles to read 佢哋帶眼鏡嚟讀 k''ü-ti tai ngan-keng lai tuk books 書 shü

26 Why do you open your 爲乜野你擘個口咁 wai-mät-ye ni mak ko hau kom month so? 大呢 tai ni?

27 I fear I was gaping 我怕我打喊露 ngo p''a ngo ta-ham-lo

28 Look at that Spaniard; he 睇吓响個呂宋人,佢 t''ai ha ko-ko Lü-sung yan, k''ü wants to sneeze! 想打嚇哆 seung ta hat-ch''i

29 Did he come here by ship or 佢打船隻打路來 k''ü ta shün chi ta lo loi ke by road? 嘅呢 ni?

30 How many guests came with 幾多個人客同埋佢 ki to ko yan-hak t''ung mai k''ü him? 來呢 loi ni?

31 I think some Annamites came 我估有幾個安南人 ngo ku yau ki ko On-nam yan with him 同佢來 t''ung k''ü loi

32 If the guest comes tell him I 若係個人客來到, yeuk hai ko yan-hak loi to, tsau am taking tiffin 就話佢知我食 wa k''ü chi ngo shik

僅晏晝 kān an-chau

33 Are these Englishman gam- 响啲英吉利人係賭 ko-ti Ying-kat-li yan hai to-pok-

blers?博佬唔係呢 lo ''m hai ni?

34 No, the Americans and the 唔係,响啲花旗人 ''m hai, ko-ti Fa-k''i yan kung On- Annamites are gamblers 共安南人係賭 nam yan hai to-pok-lo 博佬

35 Did he sail to France? 佢駛去佛蘭西咩 k''ü shai hü Fat-lan-sai me?

36 No. he did not go there; he 唔係,佢冇去响處, ''m hai, k''ü mo hü ko-ch''ü, heung stayed here响呢處啫 ni-ch''ü che

37 Did he sneeze very much 佢打好多嚇哆咩 k''ü ta ho to hat-ch''i me?

38 No, he gaped and said he was 唔係,佢打喊露又 ''m hai, k''ü ta ham-lo yau wa sleepy 話眼瞓添 ngan-fān t''im

