d>Myelderbrother</td><td>家兄</td><td>ka-hing</td></tr><tr><td>Myyounger(cottage)brother</td><td>舍弟</td><td>she''tai''</td></tr><tr><td>Mywife</td><td>老婆</td><td>lo''-p''oh</td></tr><tr><td>Do.</td><td>内人</td><td>noi''yan</td></tr><tr><td>Do.</td><td>内室</td><td>noi''shat</td></tr></table>KA-FU家父canalsobeusedforyourfather;SAI-LO細佬istheeverydaytermusedforyoungerbrother;FU-YAN夫人istheordinarytermforyourwife.', 'verified'),
