24 Hang those clothes up for 同我掛起嗰啲衣服 t''ung ngo kwa-hi ko-ti i-fuk me

25 Let me (lit. wait till I) wash 等我在呢處洗吓 tāng ngo tsoi ni-ch''ü sai ha tui my hands here 對手 shau

26 Does the bookseller sell many 嗰個賣書佬賣好多 ko-ko mai-shü-lo mai ho to books? 書咩 shü me?

27 He has only sold one volume 佢獨係賣嘵一本啫 k''ü tuk hai mai hiu yat pun che

28 Don''t get in the light; I want 咪遮住嗰啲光; 我 mai che chü ko ti kwong; ngo to read (aloud) 要讀書 iu tuk shü

29 What do you waut to write? 你要寫乜野呢 ni iu se mat-ye ni?

30 He doesn''t want to write any- 乜野佢都唔想寫 mât-ye k''ü to ''m seung se thing

31 Is that affair quite finished? 嗰件事喊彭哈完 ko kin sze ham-pang-lang ün hiu嘵囉咩 lo me?

32 It is not yet finished 未曾完 mi ts''ang ün

33 It should have been finished昨日應該做完嘅tsok-yat ying-koi tso-ün ke yesterday喇la

34 It is finished, but it is not 做完咯，但係唔做 tso-ün lok, tan hai ''m tso täk well done 得好 ho

35 Can any man do it well? 有人可以做得好唔呢 yau yan ho-i tso tak ho ''m ni?

36 You had better go and ask 你去問吓好啫 ni hü män ha ho che', '17Thepilotisonboardtheship個帶水人喺船嚟kotai-shui-yanhaishunlai18Dotheynotfearpirates?佢哋唔怕海賊咩k''ü-ti''mp''ahoi-ts''akme?19Thepoliceseizedthepilferer嗰啲差役捉倒個小ko-tich''ai-yikchuktokosiu-shau20Thismanisveryill;calla呢個人病十分重;ni-koyanpengshap-fanchung;doctor請個醫生嚟喇ts''ingkoi-shanglaila21Takethesethingstothe擰呢啲野去個當舖ningni-tiyehükotong-p''o-lopawnhroker佬處ch''ü22Doesthepastrycookmake嗰個麵食師傅噲整ko-komio-shik-sze-fuuichingcakes?餅唔呢peng''mni?23Lookforthatbookofmine尋着我嘅本書ts''am-cheukngokepunshü24Hangthoseclothesupfor同我掛起嗰啲衣服t''ungngokwa-hiko-tii-fukme25Letme(lit.waittillI)wash等我在呢處洗吓tāngngotsoini-ch''üsaihatuimyhandshere對手shau26Doesthebooksellersellmany嗰個賣書佬賣好多ko-komai-shü-lomaihotobooks?書咩shüme?27Hehasonlysoldonevolume佢獨係賣嘵一本啫k''ütukhaimaihiuyatpunche28Don''tgetinthelight;Iwant咪遮住嗰啲光;我maichechükotikwong;ngotoread(aloud)要讀書iutukshü29Whatdoyouwauttowrite?你要寫乜野呢niiusemat-yeni?30Hedoesn''twanttowriteany-乜野佢都唔想寫mât-yek''üto''mseungsething31Isthataffairquitefinished?嗰件事喊彭哈完kokinszeham-pang-langünhiu嘵囉咩lome?32Itisnotyetfinished未曾完mits''angün33Itshouldhavebeenfinished昨日應該做完嘅tsok-yatying-koitso-ünkeyesterday喇la34Itisfinished,butitisnot做完咯，但係唔做tso-ünlok,tanhai''mtsotäkwelldone得好ho35Cananymandoitwell?有人可以做得好唔呢yauyanho-itsotakho''mni?36Youhadbettergoandask你去問吓好啫nihümänhahoche', 'verified'),
