Gimlet 手鑽 shau''-tsün'' Saw 鋸 kü''', '43Kon竿apole,isappliedtobamboos,sticks,etc.44Chü''炷awick,,,aclusterofincensesticks,pencils,orsmallpencil-likearticles.45*Fo''*夥anassociate,,,parties,bands,companies,etc.46Măn文lines,spots,,cash,andmayratherbeconsideredasanindependentwordthanaclassifier.Ithoweverpreccdsts''in錢inthephrase"howmuchmoney."47Mun門adoor,,,piecesofartillery.48Hau''口amouth,&Ham咸all,,,pistols,revolvers,andsmall-arms.Tolookoutaradical查字部ch''atsz''po''Toexplainclearly---解明白kai''ming-pakWhatisitsmeaning?點解呢tim''kai''ni?Sayitagain-再講過tsoi''kong''kwo''I''lltroubleyouto——-多煩你to-fanni''Hotweather熱天itt''inMuchrain雨多ü''toGoodmorning!早晨tso''-shänExcusemydisrespect失敬shatking''Manythanks!多謝to-tse''Permitme容我yungngo''Asyouplease-隨便tsui-pin''Acarpenter木匠muk-tseung''Square曲尺huk-ch''ekTools(generally)器具hi''-kü''Screw螺絲lo-szeToolchest鐵器箱t''it-hi-seungAwl錐chuiHone磨刀石mo-to-shekChisel鑿tsokScrew-driver螺絲鑽lo-sze-tsün''Drill鑽tsün''Do.螺絲擰lo-sze-ning''File銼ts‘oh''Hammer鐵鎚t''it-ch''uiNail釘tengPincers鐵鉗t''it-k''imPlane刨p''auAxe斧頭fu''-t''auRule尺ch''ekGimlet手鑽shau''-tsün''Saw鋸kü''', 'verified'),
  ('cvh-126-01', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', '1874', 126, 1, NULL, '1 What sort of weather have you 你喺省城時天氣點 ni hai shang-shing shi t''in-hi tim at Canton? 樣呀 yeung a?

