11 Did he clearly explain what 佢有解明你聽佢要 k''ü yau kai-ming ni t''eng k''ü in he wanted? 乜野冇呢 mät-ye mo ni?

12 You are mistaken; he does not 你錯咯; 佢唔要噉 ni tsoh lok; k''ü ''m iu kom yeung

want this sort of book 樣嘅書 ke shü

13 May I trouble you to explain 我可以煩你解呢個 ngo ho-i fan ni kai ni ko tsz this character? 字麽 moh?

14 What is the meaning of that 响句說話點解呢 ko kü shüt-wa tim kai ui?

word?

15 I did not hear you; please say 我唔聽見；多煩你 ngo ''m t''eng kin; to-fan ni tsoi it again 再話過喇 wa kwo la

