  ('cvh-147-01', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', '1874', 147, 1, NULL, '38 Does your head pain you? 你嘅頭令你痛咩 ni-ke t''au ling ni t''ung me?

39 Not very much; but I am unwell 唔係十分痛啫，但係我唔精神 ''m hai shap-fān t''ung che; tan hai ngo ''m tsing-shān

40 You will have to take some medicine 你要吃藥正做得咯 ni in yak yeuk ching tso tik lok', '38Doesyourheadpainyou?你嘅頭令你痛咩ni-ket''aulingnit''ungme?39Notverymuch;butIamunwell唔係十分痛啫，但係我唔精神''mhaishap-fānt''ungche;tanhaingo''mtsing-shān40Youwillhavetotakesomemedicine你要吃藥正做得咯niinyakyeukchingtsotiklok', 'needs_review');

