  ('cvh-147-02', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', '1874', 147, 2, 'LESSON XLVI.', '"Times" (or turns) is translated by PIN 遍 as well as by UI 回; e.g. how many times? KI TO PIN NI 幾多遍呢.

