  ('cvh-148-01', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', '1874', 148, 1, 'CLASSIFIERS.', '61. Tim'' 點 a spot or dot, is applied to dots, spots, moments, hours of the clock, etc.

