None of is it clear (comprehensible) 冇啲明白嘅 mo'' ti ming-pak ke''

Just like that 同嗰個一樣 t''ung ko''-ko'' yat yeung''

I''m sure of it 我知真嘅咯 ngo'' chi chăn ke'' lok

What is it good for? 做乜使好呀 tso` mât shai'' ho'' a?

It is neither 兩個都唔係 leung'' ko'' to ''m hai''

