  ('cvh-164-01', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', '1874', 164, 1, NULL, 'What makes you think so? 爲乜噉想呀 wai''-mät kom'' seung'' a?

I won''t be done by you 唔聽你噤咯 ''m t''eng ni'' t''am'' lok

Not very good 唔係甚好嘅 ''m hai'' shām'' ho'' ke''

Is that all?係咁多咩 hai'' kom'' to me?

Understand all明白嘥咯 ming-pak sai'' lok

No matter what sort 唔論邊樣 ''m lun'' pin yeung''

Had it before 先日有過 sin yat yau kwo''

I will buy it all 隴總買嘥 lung''-tsung'' mai'' sai''

I''ve no more 我冇嘵咯 ngo'' mo'' hiu lok

Exactly suits me 正合我嘅 ching hop ngo'' ke''

Mutton broth 羊肉湯 yeung-yuk-t''ong Cuttle fish 墨魚 mak-ü

Mutton chops 羊排骨 yeung-p''ai-kwat Turtle 脚魚 keuk-ü

Lobster 龍蝦 lung-ha Shell-fish 鮑魚 pau-ü

Lard 猪油 chu-yau Salted fish 鹹魚 ham-ü

Goose (wild) 鴈鵝 ngan`-ngo Fins 魚翅 ü-ch''i''

Goose 鵝 ngo Jelly 凍 tung''

1 Have you been to his house 你今日有去過佢嘅 ni kām-yat yau hü kwo k''ü ke to-day? 屋冇呢 uk mo ni?

2 I went there this morning early 我今朝好早去咯 ngo kām-chiu ho tso lüi lok

3 Will he come again this今晚佢重來唔呢 kām-man k''ü chung loi ''m evening? ni?

4 They will all be here to-night 佢哋喊嘭哈今夜來 k''ü-ti ham-pang-lan kām ye loi

5 Tell the carpenter to come 呌個木匠佬朝頭早 kiu ko muk-tseung-lo chiu t''au early in the morning 早的來 tso tso ti loi

6 I don''t like to be away at 我夜晚黑唔中意 ngo ye man hak ''m chung-i night 出去 ch''ut hü

7 Do you read books in the fore- 你上晝只下晝讀書 ni sheung-chau chi ha-chau tuk noon or afternoon? 呢 shü ni?

8 Twelve o''clock is the same as 十二點鐘即係晏晝咯 shap-i tim chung tsik hai an-chau lok noon

