33 I think it unfit to eat because it was not made to-day 我估佢唔好食, 因爲唔係今日整嘅 ngo ku k''ü ''m ho shik, yan-wai ''m hai käm-yat ching ke

34 Did all those people walk in喊嘭哈咁多人都係 ham-pang-lan kom to yan to hai the procession?出游嘅咩 ch''ut yau ke me?

35 A good many walked; not 有好多係; 但唔係 yau ho to hai; tan ''m hai ham-all of them 喊嘭哈嘅 pang-lan ke

36 Bamboo tubes are used for竹筒用嚟整好多 chuk-t''ung yeung lai ching ho many things野 to ye

37 They are used to make pens 用嚟整筆共鞭竿 yeung lai ching pat kung pin-and sticks kon

38 Does the cook use lard in個火頭煎羊排骨用ko foh-t''au tsin yeung-p''ai-kwat cooking mutton chops?猪油唔呢yeung chü-yau ''m ni?

39 Tell him I don''t like him to 話佢聽我唔中意佢 wa k''ü t''ing ngo ''m chung-i k''ü use that 用响啲 yeung ko-ti

40 Ask him why he does not do 問吓佢爲乜事唔照 màn ha k''ü, wai-mät-sze ''m chiu

as he is told? 依佢吩咐噉樣 i k''ü fān-fu kom yeung

