  ('cvh-172-01', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', 'canton-vernacular-handbook', '1874', 172, 1, NULL, 'The foregoing conclude the list of classifiers. Many of them are only occasionally used, while others form unvarying compounds with the words they qualify. A perfect acquaintance with them is invaluable to the foreign speaker of Chinese, their correct application often ensuring comprehension when a mistake is made in the tone of a word.

