(37) .一福音聖詩 ''GOSPEL HYMNS.'' Issued by S.B.C., Canton. Leaves 25. Size 8⅛ inches by 5⅛ inches. Printed from wooden blocks. Published by the Baptist Tract Society, Canton, 1884.

