(48) .一耶穌道理問答. ''A SMALL CATECHISM OF CHRISTIAN DOCTRINE.'' Prepared by Miss Lewis, A.P.M., Canton, and printed at her own expense. Leaves 18. Size 6⅛ inches by 4⅛ inches. Printed from wooden blocks. No date, or place of publication on title page.

