  ('rcc-054-01', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', '1894', 54, 1, NULL, 'Sometimes he preached to people in a place like a church; sometimes he preached in the fields; sometimes he sat on the top of a hill and preached; and sometimes he sat in a ship, and the people stood by the edge of the water to hear him.

Jesus did not always live in the same place: he used to walk about from one place to another. Did Jesus walk about alone?—No; he had twelve friends always with him. He called them his twelve disciples. ''Peep of Day,'' pp. 83,84.

有時喺禮拜堂，有時喺田間，有時喺山頂，又有時喺船上，個啲聽嘅就企晒岸邊嚟。

耶穌傳道教人，周圍都去，唔係喺實一笪地方嘅。佢周圍去講道理，係獨自己一個去嘅唔係呢，唔係，佢有十二個朋友同佢去，個十二人，係稱為十二門徒。', 'Sometimeshepreachedtopeopleinaplacelikeachurch;sometimeshepreachedinthefields;sometimeshesatonthetopofahillandpreached;andsometimeshesatinaship,andthepeoplestoodbytheedgeofthewatertohearhim.Jesusdidnotalwaysliveinthesameplace:heusedtowalkaboutfromoneplacetoanother.DidJesuswalkaboutalone?—No;hehadtwelvefriendsalwayswithhim.Hecalledthemhistwelvedisciples.''PeepofDay,''pp.83,84.有時喺禮拜堂，有時喺田間，有時喺山頂，又有時喺船上，個啲聽嘅就企晒岸邊嚟。耶穌傳道教人，周圍都去，唔係喺實一笪地方嘅。佢周圍去講道理，係獨自己一個去嘅唔係呢，唔係，佢有十二個朋友同佢去，個十二人，係稱為十二門徒。', 'needs_review'),
  ('rcc-054-02', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', '1894', 54, 2, 'LESSON, VIII.', 'Jesus often went into a ship with his disciples. Peter had a ship of his own, and John had another ship, and they liked to lend their ships to Jesus.

Once they were all in a ship, when the wind blew very hard and the water moved up and down, and came over the ship. The disciples were afraid that they should be drowned.

耶穌常有同門徒坐船過海，彼得自己有隻船，約翰都有隻，佢兩人，好中意借個隻船過耶穌嘅。

有一日，大眾喺船上，到海中間，忽然翻起大風大浪，個啲水打入船裏上下滿，個隻船上下沉咁關係，門徒各人好慌，怕噲浸死。', 'Jesusoftenwentintoashipwithhisdisciples.Peterhadashipofhisown,andJohnhadanothership,andtheylikedtolendtheirshipstoJesus.Oncetheywereallinaship,whenthewindblewveryhardandthewatermovedupanddown,andcameovertheship.Thediscipleswereafraidthattheyshouldbedrowned.耶穌常有同門徒坐船過海，彼得自己有隻船，約翰都有隻，佢兩人，好中意借個隻船過耶穌嘅。有一日，大眾喺船上，到海中間，忽然翻起大風大浪，個啲水打入船裏上下滿，個隻船上下沉咁關係，門徒各人好慌，怕噲浸死。', 'needs_review'),
