Jesus disseminate doctrine teach men all round also go, not is at fixed one spot place, 15. He all round go speak doctrine is only himself one [C.] go not is eh? 53. Not is; he had twelve [C.] friends with him go. Those twelve men were styled twelve disciples.', '¹Yaushihailaí-pai²-t''ong;²yaushihait''inkán;³yaushihaishán-teng†;yau²³yaushihaishünshöng²,ko²-tit''eng†ke²tsau²k''éisaingon²-pínlai.Ye-soch''ün-to²kau¹yanchau-waitohui¹,mhai²haishat²yat²táttei²-fongke¹.K''öüchau-waihui¹kongto²-leihai²tuk²tsz²-keiyatko''hui''ke³mhai²ni?Mhai²;k''öüyanshap²-yi²ko³p''ang-yaut''ungk''öühui''.Ko''shap²-yi²yanhai²ch''ingwai²shap²-yi²mún-t''o.Havetimesatchurch;havetimesinfields;sometimesathilltopalso;sometimesonship-board,thoselisteningjuststandallshoresidecome.Jesusdisseminatedoctrineteachmenallroundalsogo,notisatfixedonespotplace,15.Heallroundgospeakdoctrineisonlyhimselfone[C.]gonotiseh?53.Notis;hehadtwelve[C.]friendswithhimgo.Thosetwelvemenwerestyledtwelvedisciples.', 'verified');

