  ('rcc-065-01', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', '1894', 65, 1, 'LESSON, XII.', 'Shap₂ Shing² Kai³.

Tai² yat, kai³. —

‘Shan wá², ‘Ch’ü-hiú ngo chí ngoi², néi m hò yau pit₂ ko’ Shan.’

