  ('rcc-066-01', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', '1894', 66, 1, NULL, 'The Fourth Commandment.—

''Remember the Sobbath Day to keep it holy. Six days shalt thou labour and do all thy work : But the seventh day is the Sabbath of the Lord thy God : in it thou shalt not do any work, thou nor thy son, nor thy daughter, thy manservant, nor thy maidservant, nor thy cattle, nor thy stranger that is within thy gates : For in six days the Lord made heaven and earth, the sea, and all that in them is, and rested the seventh day : wherefore the Lord blessed the Sabbath Day and hallowed it.''

The Fifth Commandment.—

''Honour thy father and thy mother: that thy days may be long upon the land which the Lord thy God giveth thee.''

The Sixth Commandment.—

''Thou shalt not kill.''

The Seventh Commandment.—

''Thou shalt not commit adultery.''

The Eight Commandment.—

''Thou shalt not steal.

The Ninth Commandment.—

''Thou shalt not bear false witness against thy neighbour.''

第四誡。

你要記念安息日,守佢做聖日。六日內,要做你各樣工夫,第七日,係你神即和華嘅安息,個日唔好做工夫,你共你嘅仔女,僕婢,畜牲,與及你屋內嘅人客,都要噉,因爲六日間,即和華創造天地海,共其中嘅萬物,到第七日,就安息,故此即和華祝福安息日,以個日爲聖日。', 'TheFourthCommandment.—''RemembertheSobbathDaytokeepitholy.Sixdaysshaltthoulabouranddoallthywork:ButtheseventhdayistheSabbathoftheLordthyGod:initthoushaltnotdoanywork,thounorthyson,northydaughter,thymanservant,northymaidservant,northycattle,northystrangerthatiswithinthygates:ForinsixdaystheLordmadeheavenandearth,thesea,andallthatinthemis,andrestedtheseventhday:whereforetheLordblessedtheSabbathDayandhallowedit.''TheFifthCommandment.—''Honourthyfatherandthymother:thatthydaysmaybelonguponthelandwhichtheLordthyGodgiveththee.''TheSixthCommandment.—''Thoushaltnotkill.''TheSeventhCommandment.—''Thoushaltnotcommitadultery.''TheEightCommandment.—''Thoushaltnotsteal.TheNinthCommandment.—''Thoushaltnotbearfalsewitnessagainstthyneighbour.''第四誡。你要記念安息日,守佢做聖日。六日內,要做你各樣工夫,第七日,係你神即和華嘅安息,個日唔好做工夫,你共你嘅仔女,僕婢,畜牲,與及你屋內嘅人客,都要噉,因爲六日間,即和華創造天地海,共其中嘅萬物,到第七日,就安息,故此即和華祝福安息日,以個日爲聖日。', 'needs_review'),
