  ('rcc-068-02', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', '1894', 68, 2, '第十誡。', '你唔好貪人屋舍,唔好貪人妻,與及人嘅僕婢牛驢,共佢凡人所有嘅。(or 有嘅野)。', '你唔好貪人屋舍,唔好貪人妻,與及人嘅僕婢牛驢,共佢凡人所有嘅。(or有嘅野)。', 'needs_review'),
  ('rcc-068-03', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', '1894', 68, 3, 'LESSON XIII.', 'The Creed :—

I believe in God the Father Almighty, Maker of heaven and earth.

