  ('rcc-083-01', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', '1894', 83, 1, NULL, 'Wak, yau paï tai²-yi² wai*, tsau²yiú wing, k''öü yap ko-ti sz-tau shü. Ko, wong m chi wai²-mat ni-ti yan kiù, k''öü ch''ut, kom-ke ming²-ling. Ngo kwu wak, k''öü chi-to Tán²-yi-lei yat-yat, köm to chōng pai Shan, k''öü tsau² m wui ch''ut, kom-ke ming²-ling. yan-wai² k''öü ho oi Tán²-yi-lei ke.

