  ('rcc-090-01', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', '1894', 90, 1, NULL, 'Daniel said, ''O King, live for ever. My God hath sent his angel, and hath shut the lions'' mouths, that they have not hurt me: because I had done nothing wrong.''

