  ('rcc-091-01', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', '1894', 91, 1, NULL, 'K''öü tsik-hak, t''eng†-kin² Tán²-yi²-lei táp. K''öü wa², ''Wong á'', ngo-ke² Shan tai-fät. K''öü-ke² t''in-sz shän-chü² ko²-ti sz-ke² hau, táng k''öü m shöng tak, tò ngo: yan ngo hai² mò tsó² ts''o² sz².''

