Then near-up-to-went called him to get up. The only son immediately then again lived, 32. When the widow saw the son again lived, then ten parts happy, 32.

Also have one [C.] dead man, name called Lazarus. Already buried four days so long, 32. Jesus went grave place, called him back-to life; he immediately then from grave again out came. * * *.

