He then answered the father, saying, ''I have-served you so many years not at all rebelled-against your orders: you also not yet give one [C.] kid (or young sheep) to me, so-that I with friends together rejoice: but it-is your [C.] son with harlots swallowed all your family property, he once arrived, you then, on-account-of him, slaughter the [C.] fat calf, (do you), eh? 26, 39.

