Jehovah is my shepherd; I certainly not arrive-at want.

Makes me lie-down in fresh grass''s ground: leads me to-stop in still water''s side.

Causes my soul to-revive : on-account of his name, guides me straight to walk rightconsness road.

I although pass through Infernal Shade (and) Danger of Death''s Valley, also not fear suffer injury; because You constantly at my side. Your rod, Your staff certainly comfort me.

In my enemy''s presence, for me prepare feast.

