  ('rcc-118-01', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', '1894', 118, 1, NULL, 'He maketh wars to cease unto the end of the earth; He breaketh the bow and cutteth the spear in sunder; He burneth the chariots in the fire.

Be still, and know that I am God: I will be exalted among the nations, I will be exalted in the earth.

The Lord of hosts is with us; the God of Jacob is our refuge.—Forty-sixth Psalm.

佢令全地停息爭戰，將弓拗折，將鎗整斷，撼火燒嗰啲車。

對世人話，你哋須當安靜，要知我係神，列邦之人必尊祟我，我必受天下所尊祟。

萬軍之主耶和華同我哋，雅各之神，係我之堅城。', 'Hemakethwarstoceaseuntotheendoftheearth;Hebreakeththebowandcutteththespearinsunder;Heburneththechariotsinthefire.Bestill,andknowthatIamGod:Iwillbeexaltedamongthenations,Iwillbeexaltedintheearth.TheLordofhostsiswithus;theGodofJacobisourrefuge.—Forty-sixthPsalm.佢令全地停息爭戰，將弓拗折，將鎗整斷，撼火燒嗰啲車。對世人話，你哋須當安靜，要知我係神，列邦之人必尊祟我，我必受天下所尊祟。萬軍之主耶和華同我哋，雅各之神，係我之堅城。', 'needs_review');

INSERT INTO articles (id, corpus, issue, issue_date, page, seq, title, text, text_norm, status) VALUES
  ('rcc-118-02', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', '1894', 118, 2, 'LESSON, XXII.', 'There is therefore now no condemnation to them that are in Christ Jesus, who walk not after the flesh, but after the Spirit. For the law of the Spirit of life in Christ Jesus made me free from the law of sin and of death.

For what the law could not do, in that it was weak through the flesh, God, sending his own Son in the likeness of sinful flesh, and as an offering for sin, condemned sin in the flesh; that the ordinance of the law might be fulfilled in us, who walk not after the flesh, but after the Spirit.

故此但凡心在基督耶穌，唔係從情慾，惟從聖神嘅，就唔定罪。因爲倚賴基督耶穌，受聖神得生嘅法，就脫甩陷罪致死嘅法。

律法因爲情慾，故此無力滅罪，惟上帝打發自己之子，好似罪人嘅形狀，嚟贖人罪，消滅人身嘅罪，致令我哋唔從情慾，獨從聖神，成全律法嘅義。', 'ThereisthereforenownocondemnationtothemthatareinChristJesus,whowalknotaftertheflesh,butaftertheSpirit.ForthelawoftheSpiritoflifeinChristJesusmademefreefromthelawofsinandofdeath.Forwhatthelawcouldnotdo,inthatitwasweakthroughtheflesh,God,sendinghisownSoninthelikenessofsinfulflesh,andasanofferingforsin,condemnedsinintheflesh;thattheordinanceofthelawmightbefulfilledinus,whowalknotaftertheflesh,butaftertheSpirit.故此但凡心在基督耶穌，唔係從情慾，惟從聖神嘅，就唔定罪。因爲倚賴基督耶穌，受聖神得生嘅法，就脫甩陷罪致死嘅法。律法因爲情慾，故此無力滅罪，惟上帝打發自己之子，好似罪人嘅形狀，嚟贖人罪，消滅人身嘅罪，致令我哋唔從情慾，獨從聖神，成全律法嘅義。', 'needs_review'),
