  ('rcc-119-02', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', '1894', 119, 2, 'LESSON, XXII.', 'Kwu²- t''sz tau²- fàn sam tsoi² Kéi-tuk,

