Therefore whosoever heart (is) in Christ Jesus, not is follow lusts, but follow (the) Holy Ghost, then not condemned. Because relying-on Christ Jesus, receive Holy Spirit obtain life''s law, then take off fall-into sin until death''s law.

(The) law on-account-of lust, therefore no strength to-destroy sin, but (the) Supreme Ruler sent his own son, very like sinful man so likeness, in-order-to redeem men''s sins, destroy man body''s sin; in-order-to cause us not to-follow lust, only to-follow (the) Holy Spirit, to-perfect the laws'' righteousness.', 'Kwu²-t''sztau²-fànsamtsoi²Kéi-tuk,Ye-sò,mhai²ts''ungts''ing-yuk,waits''ungShingShanke³,tsan²mting²-tsni².Yau-wai²yi-lai²Kéi-tukYe-sò,shan²ShingShantak,shángke²fát₀,tsan²t''tü₀lat,hám²tsui²chi²szke²fát₀.Lut¢-fát¢yan-wai²ts''ing-yuk₂kwu²''tsz¢mòlik₂mit₂tsui²wai²Shong²tai¢tà-fát₂tsz²-keichí¢tsz,hô¢t''sztsui²yan''komke¢ying-chong²laishuk₂yantsui²,siümit₂yanshanke¢tsui²;chi¢ling²ngo-tei²m¢ts''ung¢ts''ing-yuk₂tuk₂ts''ungShing¢Shan,shing-¢ts''unlut¢-fát₂ke¢yi².Thereforewhosoeverheart(is)inChristJesus,notisfollowlusts,butfollow(the)HolyGhost,thennotcondemned.Becauserelying-onChristJesus,receiveHolySpiritobtainlife''slaw,thentakeofffall-intosinuntildeath''slaw.(The)lawon-account-oflust,thereforenostrengthto-destroysin,but(the)SupremeRulersenthisownson,verylikesinfulmansolikeness,in-order-toredeemmen''ssins,destroymanbody''ssin;in-order-tocauseusnotto-followlust,onlyto-follow(the)HolySpirit,to-perfectthelaws''righteousness.', 'needs_review'),
  ('rcc-120-01', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', '1894', 120, 1, NULL, 'For they that are after the flesh do mind the things of the flesh; but they that are after the Spirit the things of the Spirit. For the mind of the flesh is death; but the mind of the spirit is life and peace: because the mind of the flesh is enmity against God; for it is not subject to the law of God, neither indeed can it be: and they that are in the flesh cannot please God. But ye are not in the flesh, but in the Spirit, if so be that the Spirit of God dwelleth in you. But if any man hath not the Spirit of Christ, he is none of his. And if Christ is in you, the body is dead because of sin; but the Spirit is life because of righteousness.—''Romans, VIII: 1-10.''

因爲從情慾嘅，體貼情慾嘅事情，從聖神嘅，體貼聖神嘅事情。體貼情慾嘅人，是必死，體貼聖神嘅人，是必生，而且平安。體貼情慾嘅心，係共上帝做仇敵，因唔服上帝嘅法，亦不能服得。所以從情慾嘅人，不能得上帝歡喜。設使上帝嘅神，住在你心內，你就唔從情慾，必從聖神，但凡冇基督聖神嘅，唔係屬基督嘅咯。設使基督在你心，嘅個肉身雖因罪而死，靈魂必因義而生。', 'Fortheythatareafterthefleshdomindthethingsoftheflesh;buttheythatareaftertheSpiritthethingsoftheSpirit.Forthemindofthefleshisdeath;butthemindofthespiritislifeandpeace:becausethemindofthefleshisenmityagainstGod;foritisnotsubjecttothelawofGod,neitherindeedcanitbe:andtheythatareinthefleshcannotpleaseGod.Butyearenotintheflesh,butintheSpirit,ifsobethattheSpiritofGoddwellethinyou.ButifanymanhathnottheSpiritofChrist,heisnoneofhis.AndifChristisinyou,thebodyisdeadbecauseofsin;buttheSpiritislifebecauseofrighteousness.—''Romans,VIII:1-10.''因爲從情慾嘅，體貼情慾嘅事情，從聖神嘅，體貼聖神嘅事情。體貼情慾嘅人，是必死，體貼聖神嘅人，是必生，而且平安。體貼情慾嘅心，係共上帝做仇敵，因唔服上帝嘅法，亦不能服得。所以從情慾嘅人，不能得上帝歡喜。設使上帝嘅神，住在你心內，你就唔從情慾，必從聖神，但凡冇基督聖神嘅，唔係屬基督嘅咯。設使基督在你心，嘅個肉身雖因罪而死，靈魂必因義而生。', 'needs_review'),
  ('rcc-120-02', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', '1894', 120, 2, 'LESSON, XXIII.', 'We praise Thee, O God: we acknowledge Thee to be the Lord.

All the earth doth worship Thee: the Father everlasting.

我哋讚美主，認爲萬有之主。

主爲無始無終之父，通天下人無不敬拜。', 'WepraiseThee,OGod:weacknowledgeTheetobetheLord.AlltheearthdothworshipThee:theFathereverlasting.我哋讚美主，認爲萬有之主。主爲無始無終之父，通天下人無不敬拜。', 'needs_review'),
  ('rcc-121-01', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', '1894', 121, 1, NULL, 'Yan-wai ² ts''ung ts''ing-yuk ke ² t''aï-t''ip ² ts''ing-yuk ke ² sz ¢ ts''ing; ts''ung Shing ² Shan ke ² t''aï-t''ip ² Shan ke ² sz ¢ ts''ing. T''aï-t''ip ² ts''ing-yuk ke ² yan, shi ² pit ¢ sz; t''aï-t''ip ² Shing ² Shan ke ¢ yan, shi ² pit ¢ shang, yi- ch''e ping-on: t''aï-t''ip ² ts''ing-yuk ke ¢ sam hai ¢ kung ² Shöng ¢ tai ¢ tso ¢ ch''au-tik ¢ yan m fuk ¢ Shöng ¢ tai ¢ ke ¢ fát, yik pat ¢ nang fuk ¢ tak: sho- yi ts''ung ¢ ts''ing-yuk ke ¢ yan pat ¢ nang tak Shöng ¢ tai ¢ fün- heí Ch''it ¢ sz Shöng ¢ tai ¢ ke ¢ Shan chü ¢ tsoi ¢ nei sam noi ¢ néi tsau ¢ m ts''ung ¢ ts''ing-yuk pit ¢ ts''ung Shing ¢ Shan. Tán ¢ fán mo Kéi-tuk ¢ Shing ¢ Shan ke ¢ m hai ¢ shuk ¢ Kéi-tuk ke lok. Ch''it ¢ sz Kéi-tuk ¢ tsoi ¢ néi sam, kòm ko ¢ yuk ¢ shan sui yan tsui ¢ yi ¢ sz; ling- wan pit ¢ yan yi ¢ yi sháng.

Because follow lusts, patronise lust''s incidents; follow Holy Spirit''s, favour Holy Spirit''s matters. Favour lusts'' men, must certainly die; favour Holy Spirit''s men, must certainly live, moreover peace: favour lust''s heart is with Supreme Ruler being enemy; because not submissive Supreme Ruler''s law also not able to-be-subject able: therefore follow lust''s men not able to-obtain Supreme Ruler pleased. If Supreme Ruler''s Spirit live in your heart within, you then not follow lusts, must follow Holy Spirit. Whosoever has-not Christ''s Holy Spirit, not is belong-to Christ, 32. Supposing-that Christ in your heart, so that flesh body although on-account-of sin to die; (the) soul must on-account-of righteousness to live.', 'Yan-wai²ts''ungts''ing-yukke²t''aï-t''ip²ts''ing-yukke²sz¢ts''ing;ts''ungShing²Shanke²t''aï-t''ip²Shanke²sz¢ts''ing.T''aï-t''ip²ts''ing-yukke²yan,shi²pit¢sz;t''aï-t''ip²Shing²Shanke¢yan,shi²pit¢shang,yi-ch''eping-on:t''aï-t''ip²ts''ing-yukke¢samhai¢kung²Shöng¢tai¢tso¢ch''au-tik¢yanmfuk¢Shöng¢tai¢ke¢fát,yikpat¢nangfuk¢tak:sho-yits''ung¢ts''ing-yukke¢yanpat¢nangtakShöng¢tai¢fün-heíCh''it¢szShöng¢tai¢ke¢Shanchü¢tsoi¢neisamnoi¢néitsau¢mts''ung¢ts''ing-yukpit¢ts''ungShing¢Shan.Tán¢fánmoKéi-tuk¢Shing¢Shanke¢mhai¢shuk¢Kéi-tukkelok.Ch''it¢szKéi-tuk¢tsoi¢néisam,kòmko¢yuk¢shansuiyantsui¢yi¢sz;ling-wanpit¢yanyi¢yisháng.Becausefollowlusts,patroniselust''sincidents;followHolySpirit''s,favourHolySpirit''smatters.Favourlusts''men,mustcertainlydie;favourHolySpirit''smen,mustcertainlylive,moreoverpeace:favourlust''sheartiswithSupremeRulerbeingenemy;becausenotsubmissiveSupremeRuler''slawalsonotableto-be-subjectable:thereforefollowlust''smennotableto-obtainSupremeRulerpleased.IfSupremeRuler''sSpiritliveinyourheartwithin,youthennotfollowlusts,mustfollowHolySpirit.Whosoeverhas-notChrist''sHolySpirit,notisbelong-toChrist,32.Supposing-thatChristinyourheart,sothatfleshbodyalthoughon-account-ofsintodie;(the)soulmuston-account-ofrighteousnesstolive.', 'needs_review'),
  ('rcc-121-02', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', '1894', 121, 2, 'LESSON, XXIII.', '² Ngo-téi ² tsán ²-méi ''Chü : ying ² wai ² mán ² yau chi ² Chü.

