我哋獨倚賴主,求主令我永不至於羞愧。</td></tr></table>', '<table><tr><td>WhenThouhadstovercomethesharpnessofdeath,Thoudidstopenthekingdomofheaventoallbelievers.ThousittestattherighthandofGod,inthegloryoftheFather.</td><td>主呀,你打勝死亡之後,就爲一切信道人開曉天國之門。主呀,你坐在上主之右邊,享受聖父之榮耀。</td></tr><tr><td>WebelievethatThoushaltcometobeourJudge.WethereforeprayThee,helpThyservants,whomThouhastredeemedwithThypreciousblood.MakethemtobenumberedwithThysaintsingloryeverlasting.</td><td>我哋信主,必再降臨審問我哋。主呀,你曾用寶血贖救世人,我哋現在求主拯救。使我哋得列在聖徒之中,得享永遠榮耀。</td></tr><tr><td>OLord,saveThypeople,andblessthineheritage.</td><td>主呀,我哋求主拯救主之百姓,賜福俾主之選民。</td></tr><tr><td>Governthem,andliftthemupforever.Daybyday,wemagnifyThee;AndweworshipThyname,everworldwithoutend.Vonchsafe,OLord,tokeepusthisdaywithoutsin.OLord,havemercyuponus,havemercyuponus.OLord,letThymercylightenuponus,asourtrustisinThee.OLord,inTheehaveItrusted:Letmeneverbeconfounded.</td><td>求主常常管束我哋,扶助我哋。我哋日日稱主為尊為大。我哋尊奉主之聖名,永世無盡。我哋今日求主保佑,使我哋不犯罪。求主可憐我哋,可憐我哋。我哋獨倚賴主,求主可憐我哋。我哋獨倚賴主,求主令我永不至於羞愧。</td></tr></table>', 'verified'),
