  ('rcc-126-01', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', '1894', 126, 1, 'LESSON, XXIV.', '''Let not your heart be troubled: ye believe in God, believe also in me. In my Father''s house are many mansions; if it were not so, I would have told you; for I go to prepare a place for you. And if I go and prepare a place for you, I come again, and will receive you unto myself; that where I am, there ye may be also. And whither I go, ye know the way.'' Thomas saith unto him, ‘Lord, we know not whither thou goest; how know we the way?’ Jesus saith unto him, ‘I am the way, and the truth, and the life: no one cometh unto the Father, but by me.’

你哋心唔使憂愁,你哋信上帝,都要信我,我父嘅家中有好多住所,倘若唔係,我必先話過你哋知,因我去爲你哋預備地方,倘若我去爲你哋預備地方,我必定翻嚟接你哋到我處,等我喺個處,你都喺處,我所去之處,你哋知到,個條路,你哋都知到,哆嘛對佢話,主呀,你去邊處,我哋唔知到,點識得個條路呢,耶穌對佢話,我即係條路呀,眞理呀,生命呀,若唔係由我,有人到得父處呀。', '''Letnotyourheartbetroubled:yebelieveinGod,believealsoinme.InmyFather''shousearemanymansions;ifitwerenotso,Iwouldhavetoldyou;forIgotoprepareaplaceforyou.AndifIgoandprepareaplaceforyou,Icomeagain,andwillreceiveyouuntomyself;thatwhereIam,thereyemaybealso.AndwhitherIgo,yeknowtheway.''Thomassaithuntohim,‘Lord,weknownotwhitherthougoest;howknowwetheway?’Jesussaithuntohim,‘Iamtheway,andthetruth,andthelife:noonecomethuntotheFather,butbyme.’你哋心唔使憂愁,你哋信上帝,都要信我,我父嘅家中有好多住所,倘若唔係,我必先話過你哋知,因我去爲你哋預備地方,倘若我去爲你哋預備地方,我必定翻嚟接你哋到我處,等我喺個處,你都喺處,我所去之處,你哋知到,個條路,你哋都知到,哆嘛對佢話,主呀,你去邊處,我哋唔知到,點識得個條路呢,耶穌對佢話,我即係條路呀,眞理呀,生命呀,若唔係由我,有人到得父處呀。', 'verified'),
