  ('rcc-144-01', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', '1894', 144, 1, NULL, '<table border="1"><tr><td>Apollyon.‘There is no prince that will thus lightly lose his subjects, neither will I as yet lose thee: but since thou complainest of thy service and wages, be content to go back; what our country will afford, I do here promise to give thee.’</td><td>魔鬼話，爲王嘅，點肯俾百姓逃走呢，我是必唔放你去，若係你怕我工夫難做，工錢又少，你只管同我翻去本國，我國中所有好物件，都俾過你。</td></tr><tr><td>Christian.‘But I have let myself to another, even to the King of Princes; and how can I, with fairness, go back with thee?’</td><td>基督徒話，我已經應承別個主人，即係萬王之王咯，依理嚟論，又點跟得你翻去呢。</td></tr><tr><td>Apollyon.‘Thou hast done in this according to the proverb, “changed a bad for a worse:” but it is ordinary for those that have professed themselves his servants, after a while to give him the slip, and return to me. Do thou so too, and all shall be well.’</td><td>魔鬼話，俗語有講，拋磚引玉，你噉樣做，係拋玉引磚喇，做乜噉愚蠢呢。每每有好多人，自己話係基督嘅臣僕，過冇幾耐，忽然離開佢，仍舊歸向我，你亦照噉做就好哩。</td></tr><tr><td>Christian.‘I have given him my faith, and sworn my allegiance to him; how, then, can I go back from this, and not be hanged as a traitor?’</td><td>基督徒話，我已經同主立約，誓過願要盡忠嘅，如今若係背逆佢，豈唔係有應得嘅罪咩。</td></tr></table>', '<tableborder="1"><tr><td>Apollyon.‘Thereisnoprincethatwillthuslightlylosehissubjects,neitherwillIasyetlosethee:butsincethoucomplainestofthyserviceandwages,becontenttogoback;whatourcountrywillafford,Idoherepromisetogivethee.’</td><td>魔鬼話，爲王嘅，點肯俾百姓逃走呢，我是必唔放你去，若係你怕我工夫難做，工錢又少，你只管同我翻去本國，我國中所有好物件，都俾過你。</td></tr><tr><td>Christian.‘ButIhaveletmyselftoanother,eventotheKingofPrinces;andhowcanI,withfairness,gobackwiththee?’</td><td>基督徒話，我已經應承別個主人，即係萬王之王咯，依理嚟論，又點跟得你翻去呢。</td></tr><tr><td>Apollyon.‘Thouhastdoneinthisaccordingtotheproverb,“changedabadforaworse:”butitisordinaryforthosethathaveprofessedthemselveshisservants,afterawhiletogivehimtheslip,andreturntome.Dothousotoo,andallshallbewell.’</td><td>魔鬼話，俗語有講，拋磚引玉，你噉樣做，係拋玉引磚喇，做乜噉愚蠢呢。每每有好多人，自己話係基督嘅臣僕，過冇幾耐，忽然離開佢，仍舊歸向我，你亦照噉做就好哩。</td></tr><tr><td>Christian.‘Ihavegivenhimmyfaith,andswornmyallegiancetohim;how,then,canIgobackfromthis,andnotbehangedasatraitor?’</td><td>基督徒話，我已經同主立約，誓過願要盡忠嘅，如今若係背逆佢，豈唔係有應得嘅罪咩。</td></tr></table>', 'needs_review'),
