Devil said: ''You since do so speak, what thing to-day also rebel-against me, eh? 53. Notwithstanding (which), you if-are willing follow me back go, I also not blame you.''

Christian said:—''I formerly promised serve you because it was (that) I was in-my-young time (and) unregulated acts (and) disordered doings only, 7; now I whom serve, is the-Almighty Lord. If-indeed you seize me, I-think my-Lord certainly can let-free me. I formerly according-to you do evil, my-Lord also able to-forgive. Injuring men Apollyon, 2, I certainly say to-you to-know, I see Lord compared-with you good able much, his kingdom midst''s customs, work, wages, servants, official orders, I also am-pleased-with; you not need more to-speak; I am Lord''s servant, I am-determined must follow him, 32.''

Devil said: ''You walking this length of road may meet very many bitter troubles, 14, you ought carefully think a-bit in-order to-be-well. Your Lord''s servants obtaining guilt-against me, breaking my laws, very many not able good die; you know, 24. Them amongst there-are some-who suffer persecution to-death also not', 'Mo-''kwaïwa²:—''Neikeihai²kòm''kong,tsò²mat,kam-yat₂yau²pöü²-yik₂ngoni?Söü-yin,néiyök₂hai²''hangkan''ngofànhöü'',''ngoyik,mkwai²néi.''Kéi-tuk,-tòwá²:—''Ngots''ung-ts''inying-shingfuk₂-sz²nèi,yanhai²siúshílün*tsok,lün*wái²che;yü-kamngoshofuk₂-sz²ke'',naihai²Ts''ün-nang-ke''Chu;tsung-''sznèichap-chu''ngo,liútak''Chupitwuikái-tüt.ngo,ngots''ung-ts''inyinèihángok,ngoChüyiknangshe''-mín-ke''.Hoi²yan-keÁ''-po-luna'',ngoshat-tsoiwa²nèichi,ngokin''Chüpéi-kau''nèihotakto,k''öükwok.chung-ke''k''wai''köü,kung-fu,kung-ts''in*,shan-puk,ching''ling,ngotofún''hei;nèimshaitokong;ngohai²''Chü-ke''shan-puk,ngok''üt-yiyiùts''ungk''öüke''lok.''Mo-''Kwaiwa²:—''Neihängnit''iú-lò²,wuiyü²-chök²hotofunán²ka²,neitongsai²samsöngháchi²ho.NeiChü-kepuk₂taktsöü²ngo,fán²ngo-kefát,hótomtak²ho''szke'';neichí-to³le.K''eichungyautishau²pik-hoi²yi-''sz-ke'',yik₂mshiúá''.Neikwufnk₂-sz²k''öü,Devilsaid:''Yousincedosospeak,whatthingto-dayalsorebel-againstme,eh?53.Notwithstanding(which),youif-arewillingfollowmebackgo,Ialsonotblameyou.''Christiansaid:—''Iformerlypromisedserveyoubecauseitwas(that)Iwasin-my-youngtime(and)unregulatedacts(and)disordereddoingsonly,7;nowIwhomserve,isthe-AlmightyLord.If-indeedyouseizeme,I-thinkmy-Lordcertainlycanlet-freeme.Iformerlyaccording-toyoudoevil,my-Lordalsoableto-forgive.InjuringmenApollyon,2,Icertainlysayto-youto-know,IseeLordcompared-withyougoodablemuch,hiskingdommidst''scustoms,work,wages,servants,officialorders,Ialsoam-pleased-with;younotneedmoreto-speak;IamLord''sservant,Iam-determinedmustfollowhim,32.''Devilsaid:''Youwalkingthislengthofroadmaymeetverymanybittertroubles,14,yououghtcarefullythinka-bitin-orderto-be-well.YourLord''sservantsobtainingguilt-a