Kéi-tuk, -tò wá² :— ''Ngo Chü m tsik, -hak, kau'' ''k''öü shan-puk₂, hai² yan-wai² söng shi'' ''k''öü yau oi'' Chü-ke'' sam ''mò: yau² t''ai ''k''öü to''-taí hang ts''ung Chü m ts''ung: chi'' yu wá² m tak'' hó sz, tsoi² ''k''öü-ke'' shan-puk₂ fán yi-wai² wing-hang²; nang kau'' ngán-ts''in-ke'' fú-nán, m hai² Chü-ke'' shan-puk₂ sho söng mong², tán hai² mong² yat₂-hau²-ke fuk. ''Chü shing-chü² ''k''öü-ke wing²-kwong, kung² ko''-ti t''in-sz lok₂ lai, ''Chü-ke'' shan-puk₂ yik₂ tak, wing-kwong a''.

