few, 2. You think serve him better than serving me, eh? 39. Not-yet seen him come to-save his servants, to-deliver from my hands: If it-is (that you) have entire heart to-serve me, by your Lord, or his servants caught, I then to-the-extreme-of strength, to-the-extreme-of plans save (them) back come. This is all men what know, 24. I now also am come to-save you, 2.''

