  ('rcc-150-01', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', 'readings-in-cantonese-colloquial', '1894', 150, 1, NULL, 'APOLLYON.—''Thou didst faint at first setting out, when thou wast almost choked in the Gulf of Despond. Thou didst attempt wrong ways to be rid of thy burden, whereas thou shouldest have stayed till thy Prince had taken it off. Thou didst sinfully sleep, and lose thy choice thing. Thou wast, also, almost persuaded to go back at the sight of the lions. And when thou talkest of thy journey, and of what thou hast heard and seen, thou art inwardly desirous of vain glory in all that thou sayest or doest.''

魔鬼話，你始初行呢條路，爭啲死在憂鬱泥中，就心懶意惰咯。又你所揀嘅大包袱，應該等主替你解脫，你反靠着唔好嘅法子嚟解。而且貪瞓犯罪，失曉個部憑據書。又見個兩隻獅子，爭啲就走翻轉頭。與及行呢條路，所見所聞嘅事，你若講過人知，時時有貪名聲嘅意思，流露出嚟。

CHRISTIAN.—''All this is true, and much more which thou hast left out; but the Prince whom I serve and honour is merciful, and ready to forgive. But, besides, these infirmities possessed me in thy country, for there I sucked them in; and I have groaned under them, being sorry for them, and have obtained pardon of my Prince.''

基督徒話，你如今所講嘅，確係實事，我重有別啲惡，你未曾講及，但我所服事嘅主，心中慈悲，肯赦人罪嘅。而且呢啲惡事，我先日在你國中學嚟嘅，因個陣時，歡喜做惡事，好似食好野一樣。我被個啲罪磧住，自己埋怨，自己嗟嘆，就得主赦免咯。', 'APOLLYON.—''Thoudidstfaintatfirstsettingout,whenthouwastalmostchokedintheGulfofDespond.Thoudidstattemptwrongwaystoberidofthyburden,whereasthoushouldesthavestayedtillthyPrincehadtakenitoff.Thoudidstsinfullysleep,andlosethychoicething.Thouwast,also,almostpersuadedtogobackatthesightofthelions.Andwhenthoutalkestofthyjourney,andofwhatthouhastheardandseen,thouartinwardlydesirousofvaingloryinallthatthousayestordoest.''魔鬼話，你始初行呢條路，爭啲死在憂鬱泥中，就心懶意惰咯。又你所揀嘅大包袱，應該等主替你解脫，你反靠着唔好嘅法子嚟解。而且貪瞓犯罪，失曉個部憑據書。又見個兩隻獅子，爭啲就走翻轉頭。與及行呢條路，所見所聞嘅事，你若講過人知，時時有貪名聲嘅意思，流露出嚟。CHRISTIAN.—''Allthisistrue,andmuchmorewhichthouhastleftout;butthePrincewhomIserveandhonourismerciful,andreadytoforgive.But,besides,theseinfirmitiespossessedmeinthycountry,forthereIsuckedthemin;andIhavegroanedunderthem,beingsorryforthem,andhaveobtainedpardonofmyPrince.''基督徒話，你如今所講嘅，確係實事，我重有別啲惡，你未曾講及，但我所服事嘅主，心中慈悲，肯赦人罪嘅。而且呢啲惡事，我先日在你國中學嚟嘅，因個陣時，歡喜做惡事，好似食好野一樣。我被個啲罪磧住，自己埋怨，自己嗟嘆，就得主赦免咯。', 'needs_review'),
