  ('rcc-057-02', 'Ye sòtsoi²shai¹chishi shi shongkei nim²k öüke t infu² hochung yi tuk₂tsz² kéihaishu k éi t oShöng² taí yaushik öük éi t ongán lui²lautak hotsai long Jesusinworld stimeconstantlyrememberedthoughtofhisHeavenlyFathermuchlikedalone by himselfatplaceprayedGod havetimesheprayedtearsflowedverybitterly'),
